	(text "Protection: over-temperature, dropout / KILL, NTC-open, over-voltage, hardware OFF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 22.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 4.5 4.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 40 90 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "af54b554-1ac7-53bb-84d7-811b86d36942")
	)
	(text "LM339 open-collector comparators on +12V_ISO. Thresholds are ratios of +5V_ISO, the same rail that feeds the NTC divider."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 26.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "37eda2a1-9b1a-533a-9282-11103993a899")
	)
	(text "V_NTC (10k B3950 lug thermistor on the\nheatsink next to FET 2): 2.50 V at 25 C,\n1.52 V at 45 C, 0.75 V at 70 C, 0.49 V at\n85 C. TEMP_MON goes to the ADC: the MCU\nruns the fan from it and shows the\ntemperature."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 29.08 164.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8d0ade51-a638-5865-9de9-32fdc17d1c49")
	)
	(text "A   Heatsink NTC and TEMP_MON"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.86 42.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "79ff858b-45b0-53eb-b0f7-43f22b2fd181")
	)
	(text "In+ = 0.099 x rail (0.49 V = 85 C). Output high -> Q11\nshorts V_SET. Hysteresis via R55 from the 12 V output:\nreleases at 0.75 V = 70 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 128.08 114.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5938f6c3-28bf-52b0-93b8-e12ebab3f46d")
	)
	(text "B   Over-temperature: 85 C trip, 70 C release"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 123.92 36.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f64a6926-dd6d-5d18-afb9-04c646c7b2f6")
	)
	(text "KILL pulls every channel In- high through 4.7k + 1N4148\nwhen the DUT is absent or below 0.45 V; releases above\n0.54 V. Stops the 115 - 170 A recovery spikes of deck 04.\nR60 sees 60 V: 1206."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 283.08 116.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c4a3452e-61be-56c7-b58a-97061f5ba9d9")
	)
	(text "C   Dropout / anti-wind-up KILL: DRAIN below 0.45 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.24 36.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0abf5654-e481-5abf-a63d-0aa64254588e")
	)
	(text "NTC open or unplugged: V_NTC above 0.73 x rail (= 3.66 V, NTC > 27 k)\nforces 0 A; an open NTC would otherwise read as cold. False trip only\nbelow about 3 C. LOAD_OFF_ISO: the MCU-side OFF, 5 V logic through the\nisolator, asserted whenever the USB side is dead. OVP_OUT (block E)\njoins through D45. R65 defines the node when nothing drives it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 128.08 220.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ee6475ae-e1b0-58a3-8933-68c4741ba2be")
	)
	(text "D   NTC open and hardware OFF: all roads to OFF_GATE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 123.92 130.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "67f4afc6-664f-510e-903e-2fee5eaee372")
	)
	(text "VSEN_OA above 0.629 x rail (3.15 V = 62 V at the terminals)\nforces 0 A through OFF_GATE. Protects the 58 V fuse rating and\nthe 70 V TVS. R67 gives about 1.8 V of hysteresis. Firmware\nlatches the trip; the comparator alone would re-arm when the\nDUT sags."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 283.08 220.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8a738a79-80cd-50c3-8b4a-def3fe6e63ac")
	)
	(text "E   Over-voltage: DUT above 62 V"
